{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out to make a puzzle game but I kept adding more and more stuff I like until this popped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m not really a story or lore kinda guy, so there\u2019s none of that here. You\u2019re just a little round guy exploring a colourful world, solving logic puzzles, collecting stuff, and unlocking new areas as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s puzzle-first, but there\u2019s plenty to do between puzzles too. There's lots to explore and a few secrets to find if you\u2019re the curious type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting stuff</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Secrets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you might like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you do, but if not, thanks for checking it out anyway!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2947110?t=1758241537","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947110/7ca676fd60be2f52ac136ab2c06ac9e6770149e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758241537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947110/988bbb61134833c9e38fcfa2cb0f551338f97bb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758241537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947110/988bbb61134833c9e38fcfa2cb0f551338f97bb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758241537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3366880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out to make a puzzle game but I kept adding more and more stuff I like until this popped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m not really a story or lore kinda guy, so there\u2019s none of that here. You\u2019re just a little round guy exploring a colourful world, solving logic puzzles, collecting stuff, and unlocking new areas as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s puzzle-first, but there\u2019s plenty to do between puzzles too. There's lots to explore and a few secrets to find if you\u2019re the curious type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting stuff</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding Secrets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you might like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you do, but if not, thanks for checking it out anyway!</p>","developers":["travisisgood"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947110/header.jpg?t=1758241537","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"http